 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Layers of blankets on the ground, a cool box packed the night before, and pouring a little drink into each cup as you sit down. Keep it in bag between you and the sun, and only uncork it few minutes before drinking. You want cold, not hot, wine. It does, though it only lasts a few drinks. A cool box with ice lasts all afternoon. Pop a few ice cubes from the cooler into each box. They' keep the juice cold all day.",
